# 1580: wheel notches move the card cursor and scroll the list. 1700: a click opens the quantity board.
# 1740: hovering Yes. 1820: hovering No. 1920: Yes reports missing materials. 2010: a click dismisses it.
# 2150: Mouse2 leaves the Make menu.
